From {{etyl|gem-pro|non}} {{term/t|gem-pro|*þan||then}}. Cognate with {{etyl|ang|-}} {{term|þa|þā|lang=ang}}, {{etyl|goh|-}} {{term|danne|lang=ang}}, {{etyl|got|-}} {{term|𐌸𐌰𐌽|tr=[[þan#Gothic|þan]]|lang=got}}.

===Adverb===
{{non-adv|-}}
# [[then]], at that time

